is dependent on your own actions and performance. Howev...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID356","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID291","SecondaryAttribute":"At the start of each week, you will first be shown the expenses of your household for that week....","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>At the start of each week, you will first be shown the expenses of your household for that week. <\/div><br><div>Then, you do a task (i.e. your work shift) that gives you income. When your work shift is over, you will receive your income and you have to pay your expenses. Then, you will be shown your updated balance and you continue with the next week.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"GenInst5","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"At the start of each week, you will first be shown the expenses of your household for that week....","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID291","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID16","SecondaryAttribute":"\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><img src=\"https:\/\/leidenuniv.eu.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_5tJ0OjPIg0SuPqJ\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 50px;\" \/><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ET02.03","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"\u00a0","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[{"TextEnt