rt with your work shift.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Continue to start with your work shift.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Exp2_tot","QuestionID":"QID282","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Continue to start with your work shift.","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"RS","PrimaryAttribute":"RS_eP8cciy6x20rfil","SecondaryAttribute":"Default Response Set","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":null},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID380","SecondaryAttribute":"If you are sure that you understood everything, click on \"continue\" to start with the decisions....","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>If you are sure that you understood everything, click on \"continue\" to start with the decisions.<\/div><div>If you are not sure whether you understood everything, click on \"go back\" to re-read the instructions. <br><\/div>","DataExportTag":"TD_inst3","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"If you are sure that you understood everything, click on \"continue\" to start with the decisions....","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"continue"},"2":{"Display":"go back"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID380","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID334","SecondaryAttribute":"If you have any feedback on the study, please let us know here.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"If you have any feedback on the study, please let us know here.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Feedback","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ESTB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionDescription":"If you have any feedback on the study, please let us know here.","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID334"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID286","SecondaryAttribute":"In each week, you will do one shift of work. Your job is to type letter strings backwards. You wi...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>In each week, you will do one shift of work. Your job is to type letter strings backwards. You will be shown 10 strings consisting of 10 characters (letters and numbers) that you have to type in the reversed order. One work shift has a set time of 100 seconds.<br>\n&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><strong><u>Example:&nbsp;<\/u><\/strong><\/div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>String presented:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.5pt;\">12345abCDE<\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.5pt;\">C<\/span>orrect answer:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.5pt;\">EDCba54321<\/span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>After 1:40 minutes, your shift ends and you are automatically forwarded to the next page.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><br>\nIn your work shift, you earn income in two ways. First, you will earn a fixed amount of income (i.e. your fixed salary) by doing the task. Second, you will earn a bonus income (i.e. your flexible bonus), for each string that you did correctly. This means that the more strings you have correct within the set time, the higher your income will be.<\/div>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ET_Inst1","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In each week, you will do one shift of work. Your job is to type letter strings backwards. You wi...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID286","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID158","SecondaryAttribute":"In the household game, your income and expenses change the amount of money you have on your balan...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>In the household game, your income and expenses change the amount of money you have on your balance. Income you receive from your work shift will increase your balance, expenses that you will have to pay decrease your balance. You start with a balance of &pound;0.00. During the game, you will be shown your updated balance each week.&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div>If your income is higher than your expenses, your balance increases.<\/div>\n\n<div>If your income is lower than your expenses, your balance decreases.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div><br \/>\nThe game is played over six weeks. At the end of the game, your final balance will determine whether you will be paid more or less than &pound;3.25 for participating in the study:\n<div>&nbsp;\n<ul>\n\t<li>If your balance after six weeks is close to 0, you will earn approximately &pound;3.25 for participating in this study.<\/li>\n\t<li>If your balance after six weeks is positive, you will earn&nbsp;more money for participating in this study (with a maximum of &pound;4.50).<\/li>\n\t<li>If your balance after six weeks is negative, you will earn less money for participating in this study (with a minimum of &pound;2.00).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"GenInst3","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In the household game, your income and expenses change the amount of money you have on your balan...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID158","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID337","SecondaryAttribute":"In this graphic, you can see the structure of the household game.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"In this graphic, you can see the structure of the household game.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q167","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","SubSelector":"WTXB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In this graphic, you can see the structure of the household game.","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"Graphics":"IM_ezLjj2gDVokdQmp","GraphicsDescription":"Household game overview TD3.png","QuestionID":"QID337","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID333","SecondaryAttribute":"In this part of the study, we ask you to make a set of 21 choices between an immediate smaller re...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>In this part of the study, we ask you to make a set of 21 choices between an immediate smaller reward and a delayed larger reward. The rewards range from &pound;15 to &pound;85. The delays range from 10 to 75 days.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><u>All 21 choices have the following structure:<\/u><\/div>\n<em>What option do you prefer?<\/em>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li><em>Receive &pound;XX today.<\/em><\/li>\n\t<li><em>Receive &pound;YY in ZZ days.<\/em>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n<div><br \/>\nOut of all 160 participants who complete the study, three will be randomly selected. For each of the selected participants, one of their choices will be randomly selected and paid out based on which option they chose.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis means that if you are one of these participants, one of your choices will be randomly selected and paid out to you. The payment will be done via Prolific. The immediate choice will be paid today, whereas the delayed option will be paid after as many days as stated.<\/div>\n\n<div><br \/>\n<u>Example:<\/u><br \/>\n<em>What option do you prefer?<\/em><\/div>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li><em>Receive &pound;25 today.<\/em><\/li>\n\t<li><em>Receive &pound;45 in 15 days.<\/em><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n<div><br \/>\nIf you were selected and had chosen option 1, you would receive &pound;25 today.<br \/>\nIf you were selected and had chosen option 2, you would receive&nbsp;&pound;45 in 15 days.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><strong>To make sure that you get the option you prefer in case you are selected, it is best to make each choice as though it was the one that will be paid out.<\/strong><br \/>\n<br \/>\nIt is very important that you understand these instructions correctly. If something is not entirely clear to you now, please re-read the instructions.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"TD_inst2","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In this part of the study, we ask you to make a set of 21 choices between an immediate smaller re...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID333","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID312","SecondaryAttribute":"Now that you learned what you have to do, you will do a practice shift to familiarize yourself wi...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>Now that you learned what you have to do, you will do a practice shift to familiarize yourself with the work shift. This practice shift is exactly the same as the work shifts you will do in the household game. However, as this is a practice shift, you will not receive any income.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><br><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"PT_inst1","QuestionID":"QID312","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now that you learned what you have to do, you will do a practice shift to familiarize yourself wi...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID298","SecondaryAttribute":"On the next page, there will be a practice string so that you can familiarize yourself with the t...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"On the next page, there will be a practice string so that you can familiarize yourself with the task.&nbsp;\n\n<div>For this practice string, you will only have to write one letter \nstring backwards and you will receive feedback on your performance. <br><\/div><div><br><\/div><div>When you continue to the next page, you have 20 seconds to do the practice string. When the 20 seconds are up, you will be automatically forwarded to the next page where you will receive feedback on your performance.<br><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ET_Inst2","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"On the next page, there will be a practice string so that you can familiarize yourself with the t...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID298","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID152","SecondaryAttribute":"Please enter your Prolific ID.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please enter your Prolific ID.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Prolific_ID","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please enter your Prolific ID.","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID152"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID153","SecondaryAttribute":"Please fill out these last questions to finish the study. What is your age?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please fill out these last questions to finish the study.<br><br>What is your age?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Age","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionDescription":"Please fill out these last questions to finish the study. What is your age?","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID153"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID2","SecondaryAttribute":"Please type the letter strings backwards.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please type the letter strings backwards.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ET01_head","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please type the letter strings backwards.","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionI