means that you were not selected for the extra reward for the second part of the study.<br>\n<br>\nAt last, we will ask you for your demographic information and will then inform you about your payment based on the household game.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q196","QuestionID":"QID370","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Thank you for filling out the questionnaire, you are almost done. \u00a0 The three winning participant...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID233","SecondaryAttribute":"The household game has ended. Your final balance after six rounds is \u00a3${e:\/\/Field\/Balance}. \u00a0 You.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"The household game has ended.\n\n<p>Your final balance after six rounds is \u00a3${e:\/\/Field\/Balance}.<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>You will be informed about the exact amount of your payment at the end of the study. <br><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>This is the end of the first part of the study. You will now continue with the second part.<br><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"End_household","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The household game has ended. Your final balance after six rounds is \u00a3${e:\/\/Field\/Balance}. \u00a0 You...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID233","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1KZjDQzAfdoOZfL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID293","SecondaryAttribute":"This answer was correct.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>This answer was correct